    %% Visitor flows
    PubUser -->|browse| Public
    AdminUser -->|authenticate| Auth
    AdminUser -->|manage| MW

    %% Middleware
    MW -->|authenticated| Admin
    MW -->|unauthenticated| ALogin

    %% Public page data
    PHome --> Cache --> TFeatured
    PAdopt --> TPets & TPetImg
    PStatic --> Donations

    %% Auth flows
    ALogin -->|signInWithPassword| SAuth
    AForgot -->|resetPasswordForEmail + redirectTo| SAuth
    SAuth -->|sends reset email via| Resend
    ACallback -->|exchangeCodeForSession| SAuth
    AReset -->|updateUser password| SAuth

    %% Admin → Server Actions
    ACats --> SCats
    AUsers --> SUsers
    AFeatured --> SFeatured

    %% Server Actions → DB & Storage
    SCats --> TPets & TPetImg & TPetLog & SStorage
    SUsers --> TUsers & TUserLog
    SFeatured --> TFeatured
    SFeatured -->|revalidateTag: featured-adoption| Cache

    %% AI analysis
    ACats -->|photo upload| SAPI
    SAPI --> Anthropic
